    <string name="version_19_4_whats_new_text">Please join the Dark Note Community for updates, feedback, help, or to say HELLO 😊\n\nGo to Settings ➡ Scroll to bottom ➡ Dark Note Sub-Reddit Feedback\n\n
        <font color='#8CA9CF'><b>New 🎉</b></font>\n
        • Support for Android 16\n
        • Improvement to searching capability (can now see preview for searched word for checklists)\n
        • Improvements to backup to ensure there are no issues importing and exporting\n
        • Added ability to add notes when inside a folder\n\n

        <font color='#8CA9CF'><b>Bug and Behavior Fixes</b></font>\n
        • Always working hard to ensure a pleasant crash-free experience:
        99%%+ of users do not experience any issues or crashes!\n
    </string>

